# FM-86 presets are derived control values (our format), not raw Yamaha
# sysex, so curated factory banks live in subfolders and ARE committed:
#   presets/rom1a/, presets/rom3a/, …  (import: tools/dx7_import.py rom1a.syx presets/rom1a)
# Loose imports dropped straight into presets/ stay local scratch — the
# leading-slash anchor ignores only this directory's top level, not subfolders.
/*.preset
